---
title: Tangy Punch
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Drinks
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@frozen limeade{2%6-oz cans}
@lemonade{2%6-oz cans}
@unsweetened grapefruit juice{2%19-oz cans}
@pineapple juice{2%19-oz cans}
@ginger ale{3%1-qt bottles}
@water{1%qt}
@chopped ice{3%qt}

Blend undiluted limeade and lemonade, grapefruit and pineapple juices. Just before serving, stir in ginger ale, the quart of water and ice. Makes about 50 punch-cup servings.
